name euflag
category Package
revision 55265
shortdesc A command to reproduce the flag of the European Union
longdesc This LaTeX package implements a command to reproduce the
longdesc official flag of the European Union (EU). The flag is
longdesc reproduced at 1em high based on the current font size, so it
longdesc can be scaled arbitrarily by changing the font size.
